==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*kwaljaną||to torment}}. Cognates include Old Saxon {{term/t|osx|quellian}}, Middle Dutch {{term/t|dum|quellen}} (Dutch {{term/t|nl|kwellen}}), Old High German {{term/t|goh|quellen}} (German {{term/t|de|quälen}}), Old Norse {{term/t|non|kvelja}} (Danish {{term|kvæle|lang=da}}).

